        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gevork Minaskanian, George Stambolian\n- Roles: inventor, author, educator, writer, editor\n- Topics: organic chemistry, medicinal chemistry, early gay literary movement\n- Places: New York City\n\nFacts:\n- George Stambolian was born on April 10, 1938.\n- George Stambolian was an American educator, writer, and editor of Armenian descent.\n- George Stambolian was a key figure in the early gay literary movement that emerged from New York during the 1960s and 1970s.\n- George Stambolian died on December 22, 1991, in New York City.\n- Dr. Gevork Minaskanian is the inventor and author of over 50 patents and publications in organic chemistry and medicinal chemistry.",
